## Local-First Architecture

- Store all data locally first
- Use SQLite with SQLCipher encryption
- Apply offline-capable design patterns
- Support full offline functionality
- Use @lib/db/repositories/local_repository.dart
- Implement local-first state management
- Support offline data operations

```dart
// Offline-first repository pattern
abstract class OfflineFirstRepository<T> {
  Future<List<T>> getAllLocal();
  Future<T?> getByIdLocal(String id);
  Future<void> saveLocal(T entity);
  Future<void> deleteLocal(String id);
  Future<void> syncToRemote();
}
```

